ょいっと入れていただけると嬉しいです\n\nポーズ：こちらの作品（https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/58740347）の様な感じでお願いしたいです…！もちろん完全に同じというわけではなく、あくまで「こんな感じ」というフワッとした希望です\n\nペンギン：あの立ち絵のぬいぐるみすごく気に入ってるので一緒に描いてくださると…！\nこちらの資料（https://x.com/penguinmdm/status/1741497849597366328?s=20）の2枚目にチョロッと砂漠版のペンギンがいるのですが、この子も一緒だとなお嬉しいです\n\n背景、表情、資料では不明瞭な衣装の細部、ロゴの有無：おまかせします", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 604162, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "さかきじんや", "screen_name": "sakaki_jinya", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1120243462639480837/N2zrFWbS.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/768073825565093888/1555921948/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 145}, {"id": 2048180, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "Shqueq 「シュクエク」", "screen_name": "shqueq", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1815677046024294400/dfYehaVb.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/765802649459494912/1687903612/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 17}, {"id": 3045884, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "雅楽代ましろ@Vtuber", "screen_name": "UtashiroMashiro", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2015770810326380544/limK7W6B.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1772483615349497856/1771598041/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, 